 "note": "Owner 2026-09-15: \"every video that is in the storyboard right now is what you need to finalize as a final video.\" One clip per in-film card. S04/S06 use the same shots at 1080p with sound (card copies were 640x360 silent). S24 = the 7 s clip made for the approved line. S27 = kit clip (Apu lip-syncs inside) with the owner's three close-ups as picture overlays. Scenes with no video on the card (S29A–S35) are not in this film. Pass 2: per-scene gains from measured source loudness. Pass 5: S27 = kit frames 150–314 (drops the repeated S24 line and the cut-off All right), owner close-ups INV052/INV051 over L1 and the two-months-ago line, INV053 appended with its own sound for Apu's jump-in line. Pass 6: S24 = the owner's new Kling takes (8da02e26 + tail of 4a92122b) under the approved line. Pass 7: S24 +9 dB (embedded line sat at -26.9 LUFS). Pass 8: owner removed INV051 on the board → its overlay dropped; kit lip-sync shows for the two-months-ago line. Pass 9: S27 rebuilt turn by turn — INV052 (owner L1) → kit Rexx reply 212–262 → INV037 (native lip-sync, two months ago) → INV053 (owner jump-in). No wide shot in the middle. Owner: \"after Apu says will this work… I said oh yeah a vintage mart, he says yeah two months, then jump in.\" Pass 10: two-months-ago line = INV051 (owner close-up) instead of INV037. Pass 11: S28 = INV008 (Sep 14 passenger seat) + reminder line; S29 = INV043 → INV044 → INV042 (+kit what-do-you-mean) → INV009 (+kit blood-on-forehead line) → INV050 Blood? (owner: the new ones are in the archive, you are not using them). Pass 12: owner timecode notes — snore cues 61–64 / 70–75; S18 tail = INV049 (V68 wake lip-sync, own sound); S24 tail + S27 Rexx reply = INV004 over-the-shoulder. Pass 13: Codex/owner S27 reply (document your items…) inserted after two-months-ago. Pass 14 (2026-09-16, Codex review): listening OTS (Seedance d1ca1f7a) under Rexx lines; S23 = V74 kit; ending = V74 S29 frames 252–364 (16:9, Blood? + look). | pass 15 (2026-09-16): Codex PR #19 owner corrections — Homer line 1:39, nodding 1:51, silent listeners 2:00, single fist bump."
